      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;&#39; -------------------- 6. SEQUENCE: UC-01 --------------------\n@startuml Sada_Sequence_UC01\ntitle UC-01 — Execute Internal Transfer\nautonumber\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nactor Customer\nboundary \&quot;Customer Web App\&quot; as UI\ncontrol \&quot;Banking API\&quot; as API\ncontrol \&quot;Authentication Service\&quot; as Auth\ncontrol \&quot;OTP Service\&quot; as OTP\ncontrol \&quot;Risk Engine\&quot; as Risk\ncontrol \&quot;Ledger Service\&quot; as Ledger\ndatabase \&quot;Platform Database\&quot; as DB\nCustomer -&gt; UI: Enter destination account and amount\nUI -&gt; API: Submit transfer request\nactivate API\nAPI -&gt; Auth: Validate session\nactivate Auth\nAuth -&gt; DB: Read session\nDB --&gt; Auth: Session status\nAuth --&gt; API: Authentication result\ndeactivate Auth\nalt Session invalid\n API --&gt; UI: 401 Unauthorized\n UI --&gt; Customer: Display authentication error\nelse Session valid\n API -&gt; OTP: Verify simulated OTP\n activate OTP\n OTP -&gt; DB: Validate OTP challenge\n DB --&gt; OTP: OTP status\n OTP --&gt; API: Verification result\n deactivate OTP\n alt OTP invalid\n  API --&gt; UI: 401 Invalid OTP\n  UI --&gt; Customer: Display OTP error\n else OTP valid\n  API -&gt; DB: Read account status, available balance and daily total\n  DB --&gt; API: Account and limit data\n  alt Account inactive\n   API --&gt; UI: 422 Account unavailable\n  else Account active\n   alt Insufficient balance\n    API --&gt; UI: 422 Insufficient balance\n   else Sufficient balance\n    alt Daily limit exceeded\n     API --&gt; UI: 422 Daily limit exceeded\n    else Limit passed\n     API -&gt; Risk: Evaluate transaction rules\n     activate Risk\n     Risk --&gt; API: PASS or MANUAL_REVIEW\n     deactivate Risk\n     alt Manual review required\n      API -&gt; DB: BEGIN transaction\n      API -&gt; DB: Lock source account and recheck balance\n      API -&gt; DB: Freeze amount and create HELD transfer\n      API -&gt; DB: Create linked REVIEW_CASE\n      API -&gt; DB: Append AUDIT_LOG event\n      API -&gt; DB: COMMIT\n      API --&gt; UI: 202 Accepted — Pending review\n     else Risk passed\n      API -&gt; Ledger: Execute atomic internal transfer\n      activate Ledger\n      Ledger -&gt; DB: BEGIN transaction and lock both accounts\n      Ledger -&gt; DB: Recheck available balance\n      Ledger -&gt; DB: Insert balanced debit and credit entries\n      Ledger -&gt; DB: Update account balances\n      Ledger -&gt; DB: Insert completed TRANSFER\n      Ledger -&gt; DB: Append AUDIT_LOG event\n      Ledger -&gt; DB: COMMIT\n      Ledger --&gt; API: Transfer receipt\n      deactivate Ledger\n      API --&gt; UI: 200 OK — Transfer completed\n     end\n    end\n   end\n  end\n end\nend\ndeactivate API\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="vPecKsJ7qy07KvzmN1Pw-1">
